  npcName: Hat Man
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a6adcfb84d9054ac486ef7a10722243d, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - I heard you were looking for someone?
  - Let me think. Back when this town was alive, I delivered many messages. Maybe
    what you seek is in one of my forgotten letters.
  - "But my eyesight isn't what it used to be, I\u2019m a ghost now. If you can find
    it you can have it. I think it should be past the double trees."
